OL,3,GNEWSATour highlights city's modernist  
OL,4,Alandmarks                              
OL,6,FHull's modernist, post-war landmarks   
OL,7,Fare being brought to life in a new     
OL,8,Finteractive tour.                      
OL,10,FThe city now appears on The Modernist  
OL,11,Fapp, an architectural guide produced by
OL,12,Fthe Modernist Society, which celebrates
OL,13,F20th Century design.                   
OL,15,FAlong the route, which is nearly 2.5   
OL,16,Fmiles long, walkers encounter some of  
OL,17,FHull's best-known mid-century          
OL,18,Flandmarks, including the Cecil Cinema, 
OL,19,Fthe former Hammonds Department Store   
OL,20,Fand the Three Ships mural.             
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
