OL,3,GNEWSATour highlights city's modernist  
OL,4,Alandmarks                              
OL,6,FCharlotte Tomlinson, who created and   
OL,7,Fphotographed the tour, said the city   
OL,8,Fhad "picked itself up and [been]       
OL,9,Frebuilt with real ambition" following  
OL,10,FWorld War Two.                         
